copy, change or reuse any part of it outside this port.

The voice recordings, pictures, texts and word lists are not in this repository. The port reads them from
the official, unmodified Learn or Die jar, which you get from Learn or Die's official pages.

The port is free. It is published only on Horizon's mod browser and in this repository. For problems with
the port, open an issue in this repository. For everything else, see the official mod.

